                                  "fill": "#2c2a27",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "height": 76.8,
                                  "content": "Place-Based Exploration\nOur curriculum is grounded in the landscapes we inhabit - forests, fields, and communities.",
