                              "content": "At Fieldnote, our educators are mentors, co-learners, and facilitators. They bring backgrounds in education, ecology, the arts - and above all, they bring presence. Each member of our team is here because they believe in child-led, nature-connected learning.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.6,
                              "fontFamily": "Montserrat",
                              "fontSize": 16,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
