                                  "fill": "#2c2a27",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "height": 102.41,
                                  "content": "At Fieldnote, every tool is chosen with care - not for what it does, but for what it invites. We believe materials should be open-ended, sensory-rich, and capable of growing with a child’s questions. From watercolor palettes to hand drills, our tools support curiosity, agency, and connection.",
