                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 128.01,
                              "content": "Each morning begins with intentional setup. Journals are ready, provocations arranged, and tools placed within reach of small hands. Our studio and outdoor spaces offer room to build, deconstruct, layer, and return again.",
