                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "ZEP5I",
                      "x": 401.25,
                      "y": 34.78,
                      "name": "div",
                      "context": "div",
                      "width": 733.79,
                      "height": 363.4100000000001,
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "LO6iM",
                          "name": "div",
                          "context": "div",
                          "width": 733.79,
                          "height": 363.41,
                          "layout": "vertical",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "U3DB1S",
                              "name": "The Marin Family - Trusting the Process",
                              "context": "h2",
                              "fill": "#2c2a27",
                              "content": "The Marin Family - Trusting the Process",
                              "lineHeight": 1.18,
                              "fontFamily": "Lora",
                              "fontSize": 36.74,
                              "fontWeight": "normal",
                              "letterSpacing": -0.3
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "USuHI",
                              "name": "spacer",
                              "width": 733.79,
                              "height": 32,
                              "layout": "none"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "AZYdL",
                              "name": "We found Fieldnote at a time when our so",
                              "context": "p",
                              "fill": "#2c2a27",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 76.8,
                              "content": "We found Fieldnote at a time when our son was struggling in a traditional preschool. He’s always been curious, but he didn’t thrive in loud, fast-paced classrooms. We wanted a place that would really see him - and we found that here.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.6,
                              "fontFamily": "Montserrat",
                              "fontSize": 16,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "U14H1Z",
                              "name": "spacer",
                              "width": 733.79,
                              "height": 16,
                              "layout": "none"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "Y3HMwi",
                              "name": "At first, we weren’t sure what to expect",
                              "context": "p",
                              "fill": "#2c2a27",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 76.8,
                              "content": "At first, we weren’t sure what to expect. Muddy clothes? Long days outdoors? But what we saw was transformation: he started narrating his hikes, drawing maps of the trails, asking questions about fungi.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.6,
                              "fontFamily": "Montserrat",
                              "fontSize": 16,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "TYm0u",
                              "name": "spacer",
                              "width": 733.79,
                              "height": 16.00999999999999,
                              "layout": "none"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "GLREB",
                              "name": "The educators took the time to know him ",
                              "context": "p",
                              "fill": "#2c2a27",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 102.41,
                              "content": "The educators took the time to know him deeply. They noticed things we hadn’t - like his quiet leadership or love of mapping. He now leads nature walks at home and builds “bug hotels” on weekends. More than anything, Fieldnote taught us how to trust the process and let him lead the way.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.6,
                              "fontFamily": "Montserrat",
                              "fontSize": 16,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
