                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "D5wW4H",
                              "name": "The Jones Family - A Place for All of Us",
                              "context": "h2",
                              "fill": "#2c2a27",
                              "content": "The Jones Family - A Place for All of Us",
                              "lineHeight": 1.18,
                              "fontFamily": "Lora",
                              "fontSize": 36.74,
                              "fontWeight": "normal",
                              "letterSpacing": -0.3
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "noya1",
                              "name": "spacer",
                              "width": 733.79,
                              "height": 32,
                              "layout": "none"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "xz8Zj",
                              "name": "We enrolled our daughter in the Saplings",
                              "context": "p",
                              "fill": "#2c2a27",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 51.2,
                              "content": "We enrolled our daughter in the Saplings program hoping she’d learn to love the outdoors. What we didn’t expect was how much we would grow as a family.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.6,
                              "fontFamily": "Montserrat",
                              "fontSize": 16,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "J0tSO",
                              "name": "spacer",
                              "width": 733.79,
                              "height": 15.999999999999986,
                              "layout": "none"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "NxX3o",
                              "name": "From the very first parent night, we fel",
                              "context": "p",
                              "fill": "#2c2a27",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 76.8,
                              "content": "From the very first parent night, we felt included. Fieldnote doesn’t just teach kids - it builds a whole ecosystem of support. We were invited to journal alongside our child, to join seasonal celebrations, to reflect together.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.6,
                              "fontFamily": "Montserrat",
                              "fontSize": 16,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "mQP7i",
                              "name": "spacer",
                              "width": 733.79,
                              "height": 16.00999999999999,
                              "layout": "none"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "svywQ",
                              "name": "Our daughter is now braver, more empathe",
                              "context": "p",
                              "fill": "#2c2a27",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 76.8,
                              "content": "Our daughter is now braver, more empathetic, and full of questions we don’t always have the answers to (which we love). Fieldnote gave her room to wonder - and gave us the tools to nurture that wonder at home.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.6,
                              "fontFamily": "Montserrat",
                              "fontSize": 16,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
