                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "height": 102.41,
                                  "content": "Our journal is where we reflect on what’s unfolding - on the ground, in the studio, and in the hearts and minds of our learners. These entries are shared by educators, families, and sometimes, by the children themselves.",
