                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "height": 111.99,
                                  "content": "We explored the concept of mapping - not as a tool for navigation, but as a way to tell stories. With clipboards and charcoal, the Saplings traced trails, labeled trees, and invented landmarks of their own imagination.",
