                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "height": 111.99,
                                  "content": "A thunderstorm rolled in just as we began studio time. Instead of retreating, we gathered under the canvas tarp and listened. What started as chaos became a moment of focus: water tracking, soundscaping, story writing.",
